OL,3,AG7 leaders hold urgent meeting over
OL,4,Adiesel supply as UK prices hit record
OL,5,A#2 a litre
OL,6,
OL,7,FAverage UK diesel prices have hit a
OL,8,Frecord high, according to motoring
OL,9,Fgroup the RAC, reaching #2 a litre for
OL,10,Fthe first time
OL,12,FIt comes as US President Donald Trump
OL,13,Fsays he may ask European countries to
OL,14,Frelease diesel reserves as he considers
OL,15,Fbanning US exports of the fuel
OL,17,FThe move could bring prices down
OL,18,Fsignificantly for American drivers, but
OL,19,Fexperts warn it would put further
OL,20,Fpressure on diesel prices in other
OL,21,Fcountries, as the Iran war continues to
OL,22,Fput pressure on supply.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
